    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "comment-1",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# 🎬 Product Video Generator\n\nTurns a campaign brief and product image into a cinematic 16:9 launch clip. Use it when you already have a product photo and want a short animated shot.\n\n**How it works:** \"1️⃣ Campaign brief\", \"2️⃣ Target audience\" and \"3️⃣ Key features\" fill \"5️⃣ Build prompt\". \"6️⃣ Write video prompt\" is an Agent that reads that prompt together with \"4️⃣ Product image\" and writes one image-to-video paragraph. \"7️⃣ Animate product video\" animates the same product image with that prompt for 8 seconds at 720p. Pick a language model on \"6️⃣ Write video prompt\". The animation step uses your default video model, or the one you pick on the node. It is a paid video generation, so each run costs noticeably more than an image-only template.\n\n**Try this:** Change \"2️⃣ Target audience\" to \"retirees who walk daily\" and compare the setting and pace of the new clip."
        },
        "ui_properties": {
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0
          },
          "zIndex": 0,
          "width": 560,
          "height": 362,
          "selectable": true,
          "bypassed": false
        },
        "dynamic_properties": {},
        "dynamic_outputs": {}
      },
      {
        "id": "4",
        "type": "nodetool.text.Prompt",
        "data": {
          "prompt": "Using the text and image inputs, write a video prompt for a single 16:9 product shot. Give clear instructions on the animations and movements in the video.\n\nRules:\n- Present tense, visually concrete; one clear camera move and one primary subject action.\n- Include: subject, setting, time-of-day, camera language (framing, angle, lens, movement), composition cues, lighting, 3–5 color anchors, atmosphere/texture, and realistic motion cues.\n- Emphasize the product and key features naturally within the scene for the target audience and tone.\n- Finish with constraints: no on-screen text, no logos, no watermarks, no glitches, no distorted anatomy.\n\nInputs:\n- Campaign brief: {{ brief }}\n- Target audience: {{ audience }}\n- Key features: {{ features }}"
        },
        "ui_properties": {
          "selected": false,
          "position": {
